<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SIMO BIJOUX - 99 DH</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@700&family=Poppins:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#080808;color:#fff;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif}
header{padding:15px 5%;background:#000;border-bottom:1px solid #222;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-family:'Cinzel';color:#D4B46A;font-size:22px;font-weight:700}
.logo small{display:block;color:#aaa;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:3px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:60px 5%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#1e1e1e,#000)}
.hero h1{font-family:'Cinzel';color:#D4B46A;font-size:38px;margin:0}
.badge{background:#D4B46A;color:#000;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:800;display:inline-block;margin-top:15px}
.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;padding:40px 5%}
.card{background:#151515;border:1px solid #222;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;padding-bottom:16px}
.card img{width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover}
.card h3{font-size:14px;margin:12px 8px 6px;min-height:38px}
.price{color:#D4B46A;font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
.old{color:#666;text-decoration:line-through;font-size:12px}
.btn{background:#25D366;color:#fff;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:25px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:800px){.products{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.card img{height:220px}}
@media(max-width:500px){.products{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card img{height:320px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="logo">SIMO BIJOUX<small>L'ÉLÉGANCE QUI PARLE</small></div><div style="background:#D4B46A;color:#000;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:800;font-size:12px">كلشي 99 DH</div></header>
<div class="hero"><h1>SIMO BIJOUX</h1><p style="color:#aaa;margin-top:10px">أجمل 5 موديلات الأكثر طلبا - التوصيل فابور</p><div class="badge">الدفع عند الاستلام - لجميع المدن</div></div>
<div class="products">
<div class="card"><img src="1.jpg"><h3>طقم بجعة وردي - عقد + سوار</h3><div class="price">99 DH <span class="old">199 DH</span></div><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212722250567?text=Salam%20bghit%20Cygne%20Rose%2099DH">اطلب واتساب ✅</a></div>
<div class="card"><img src="2.jpg"><h3>عقد القلب الأحمر الفاخر</h3><div class="price">99 DH <span class="old">189 DH</span></div><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212722250567?text=Salam%20bghit%20Coeur%20Rouge%2099DH">اطلب واتساب ✅</a></div>
<div class="card"><img src="3.jpg"><h3>طقم بجعة ذهبي مع الحلقات</h3><div class="price">99 DH <span class="old">249 DH</span></div><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212722250567?text=Salam%20bghit%20Cygne%20Dore%2099DH">اطلب واتساب ✅</a></div>
<div class="card"><img src="4.jpg"><h3>باك 5 براسليات - الأكثر مبيعا</h3><div class="price">99 DH <span class="old">299 DH</span></div><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212722250567?text=Salam%20bghit%20Pack%205%20Bracelets%2099DH">اطلب واتساب ✅</a></div>
<div class="card"><img src="5.jpg"><h3>عقد Van Cleef أزرق ملكي</h3><div class="price">99 DH <span class="old">199 DH</span></div><a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212722250567?text=Salam%20bghit%20Trefle%20Bleu%2099DH">اطلب واتساب ✅</a></div>
</div>
<footer style="text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#555;border-top:1px solid #222;font-size:12px">© 2025 SIMO BIJOUX - simo-bijoux.vercel.app</footer>
</body>
</html>
